{"story":{"group_1":[{"autoTurnLast":0.01,"bg":"bg_adv_21441.jpg","chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":0},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":0,"pos":2}],"turnChangeIn":"fadeIn"},{"bgm":"bgm05_event08","chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"However, if we interpret her wild behavior@as panic,","turnChangeOut":"fadeOut"},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"I can't help but feel she was in a hurry@to inform us of the presence of a Witch."},{"chara":[{"id":300301}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"We can't come to any conclusions,"},{"chara":[{"id":300301,"motion":200}],"nameLeft":"Hinano","textLeft":"but let's move under the assumption@she's warning us of danger."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300601,"motion":200}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"But, why'd it have to be us?"},{"chara":[{"id":300601}],"nameRight":"Emiri","textRight":"If it's just to warn about danger,@wouldn't any ol' kid do?"},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300301},{"effect":"fadeout","id":300601}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_050.exp3.json","id":300201,"motion":1,"pos":2},{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":300901,"motion":0,"pos":0}],"nameRight":"Natsuki","textRight":"You guys said yesterday it was all the people@who came to her rescue, didn't you?"},{"chara":[{"id":300901,"motion":0}],"nameLeft":"Manaka","textLeft":"Maybe there's some kind of connection..."},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_030.exp3.json","id":101301,"motion":300,"pos":0}],"nameLeft":"Asuka","textLeft":"Hmm..."},{"autoTurnLast":0.2,"chara":[{"effect":"fadeout","id":300201},{"effect":"fadeout","id":101301}],"textClear":1},{"chara":[{"cheek":0,"face":"mtn_ex_020.exp3.json","id":300301,"motion":0,"pos":1}],"nameCenter":"Hinano","textCenter":"Regardless, if there's danger coming I want to get@to the bottom of this as soon as possible."}